4,The fall of the Andamanese resistance: The mutineer who betrayed an...,https://www.counterview.net/2026/03/the-fall-of-andamanese-resistance.html,"Yet Tewari’s odyssey took another unexpected turn. Captured and bound, he was ferried by canoe to Tarmogli Island, where members of the Aka-Bea-da sept of the Great Andamanese nursed his wounds with earth and herbs.",Aka-Bea,Andamanese
5,Aka-Bea language of Geography Topics | Question AI,https://www.questionai.com/knowledge/kbst1yWoBV-aka-bea-language,"Bea Aka-Bea Native to India Region Andaman Islands ; South Andaman island except northeast coast, and north and east interiors; Rutland island except south coast; small islands southeast of Rutland; Labyrinth Islands. Extinct By 1931 Language family Great Andamanese Southern †.",Aka-Bea,Andamanese
6,Review: In Search of Language Contact Between Jarawa and Aka-Bea,https://linguafile0.wordpress.com/2025/12/04/review-in-search-of-language-contact-between-jarawa-and-aka-bea/,"Jarawa is an endangered member of the Ongan language family (called ‘Angan’ in this (Abbi & Kumar 2011, p.5)), established in Blevins (2007), whereas Aka-Bea is an extinct member of the Great Andamanese family...",Aka-Bea,Andamanese
