9,Chapter 8: The Tribes,https://www.andaman.org/book/chapter8/text8.html,There were some Greater Andamanese Aka-Bea tribesmen on this first of Portman’s several expeditions and they warned of the Sentinelis’ hostile intent. The British did not at this early time appreciate the many and complex enmities existing among the natives.,Aka-Bea,Andamanese
